* MULT_TB.v
*
* Test Bench for MULT.v
*
* Version: 2.02
* Author : AUDIY
* Date   : 2026/04/13
*
* License
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Copyright AUDIY 2023 - 2026.                                                 |
